Z||000001||ChadMan||10-27-1999||01:38 PM||||Definitely not, MooCow.  You should buy my 86 SE V6 with 122K for $1700!<P>If that car really has no other problems (tracks straight, steering feels tight, all accessories work, clutch takeup is smooth, etc), it's probably worth $2500.||||reg||12
